NUL

# NOTE: CHECKPOINT_A_ADMIN_CREDS.txt is intentionally TRACKED. It holds only
# plaintext LOCAL-DEV admin panel logins for the private server (the DB stores
# bcrypt hashes). Per the recovery-baseline policy this is ordinary
# private-server configuration, not an external/live secret, so it is preserved
# as part of the known-good baseline.
